WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.040
- How are your Modern Family co-stars?

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.110
Do you see them at all?

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:04.640
You guys were a family for what?

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.330
- 12 years?
- 11 years.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:07.940
11 years.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.750
I got the chance to interview Ty and Jesse

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.810
for the podcast which was great.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.440
Jesse in person was wonderful.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.230
And then this weekend I saw my dear.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:17.170
There he is,

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.640
there he is.
(audience applauding)

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.520
- Yeah, he was a great guest
on the tonight show as well.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.360
Very funny.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.710
- I mean, as good as me?

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:24.543
- No, not as good as you, certainly.

00:00:24.543 --> 00:00:26.010
- It's a different experience.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:27.210
- Different experience.
- It's different.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.552
He actually listens.

00:00:28.552 --> 00:00:30.080
- Right, right, right, right.
- It's just different.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.540
- Yeah, I could ask him a question.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.680
- Oh, yeah we know that's (mumbles)

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.440
We've done that.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.180
And then I got to see Nolan
this weekend, my baby boy.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.840
Who was all grown up and beautiful.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.810
So I don't see them nearly enough,

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.015
but, I mean I do--

00:00:44.015 --> 00:00:45.930
- Well, maybe there's a
reunion somewhere in the works,

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:47.300
somewhere down the road.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.812
- Like, your house?
(audience clapping)

00:00:48.812 --> 00:00:51.060
- Yeah, I think people would love that.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.750
- Jay Leno's Garage with
a cast of Modern Family.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:54.718
- Works for me.

00:00:54.718 --> 00:00:59.197
- I can make that happen.
(audience cheering)

